# iPhone portrait UI

This app is used on the sideline on an iPhone, held **portrait**. Every UI change must work in that frame.

- Design and verify at **390×844 CSS pixels** (iPhone 14/15/16 class). Not desktop. Not landscape.
- Layouts, tap targets, type, and spacing must fit that viewport without horizontal scroll.
- Prefer the existing phone layout (`max-width: 719px`, hamburger nav). Do not add desktop-only chrome, multi-column dashboards, or hover-only controls.
- When using a browser or Playwright, set the viewport to 390×844 (portrait) before judging layout.
- Safe areas matter: keep primary controls clear of the notch and home indicator (`viewport-fit=cover`, `env(safe-area-inset-*)`).
